# Clicks: F2 clicks the window's second row, SHIFT-F2 its first, F3 and
# SHIFT-F3 double click them.  A click sends no request, so the count
# of busy moves stays.
S START
K F2
S F2
K SHIFT-F2
S SF2
K F2
K F2
S F2AGAIN
K DOWN DOWN
S WIN2
K SHIFT-F2
S SF2WIN2
K F2
S F2WIN2
K F3
S F3
K SHIFT-F3
S SF3
K HOME
K F3
S F3HOME
K SHIFT-F3
S SF3HOME
